{"summary":"Survival real-time strategy game with tower defender mechanics.","description":"DefCom TD offers an exhilarating blend of tower defense and real-time strategy, delivering an immersive survival experience. Engage in intense battles on dynamically generated maps as you construct your base, gather vital resources, and fend off relentless waves of adversaries.\n\nKey Features:\n• Uniquely fusing TD and RTS genres for an innovative gameplay experience\n• Encounter a diverse range of enemies, from infantry units to formidable aviation forces\n• Explore endlessly diverse maps generated with each new game\n• Immerse yourself in captivating 3D graphics and immersive sound design\n• Intuitive controls designed for seamless gameplay\n• Enjoy an ad-free and In-App Purchase-free gaming environment\n\nStrategize, adapt, and overcome the odds in DefCom TD. Will you rise as the ultimate defender? The challenge awaits!\n\nGood luck and have fun!","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s93VwEjnP0c?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/A3SjmoJkHrNAz5Lbkp0nFgYT8sbDawUTzsRVXVgkxqx8HmHPeZQ_EfciRzCNpfxsBV0aDNOmwlU-B63lhbXFeg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WRx9H4YdpCHGkNp6Z42xuugMFfu_8IQGTpKGWGhzgSIpxdX49dpVRm6SZmoTLYnjITZrR0diEFTSZ9A0CMlmGA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/94TGF7lsDC0__SCCHl2z1JgNmK76cUGe9NSEdjtKFt9EV1IoJo3KPWm0i9pwNFZuCwZlEMlCz4IMvXrctlLU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AEIvVUsNsktElKFW39uD1UPRdKOOFrPX6RJhXvCMvdCTN5E2MR6rUFmX7pT75G_G3_COUAX7LbnQuUo0yDpddA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/60x33fqSo1KZZJ6GMrRKHMKmCuu-pQ55oEJdgqpNpaALzLVnH8tlgcP_NKfGEqC33ep_Z_2JbGynGIUhzZBpRA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kETUkT6EJZVBA-FwX32hmA9CDfSS90LEwDPdcqMG_XDWGl9RlofoRtXD9JYq-uHIcUfvByCKp-qgF7_sWig7","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EhV-9z7lF2GBAH2zGzR8nXE_1PylpDBaS_nOKMfPsX9ShrWi0Lxo9gfRBO